<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 16.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 16.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	May 16	May 15   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  271.300     270.060     247.020    9.83 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  311.440     311.400     306.830    1.49 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  159.495     159.740     158.970    0.33 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   47.378	47.440	47.182    0.42 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  445.340     442.780     419.180    6.24 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  141.850     142.200     141.685    0.12 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.189	16.236	16.185    0.02 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  234.860     233.780     212.430   10.56 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.889	 1.893	 1.888    0.05 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.581	 1.586	 1.581    0.00 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.310     189.265     183.135    3.37 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
